<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-16T11:50:32.210Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 11:50:32 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits continue to target civilians in Zamfara, abducting five children from the same family and attacking a mosque during Subhi prayer, killing Governor Dauda Lawal's aide and abducting worshippers. In Kano, thugs assaulted Kwankwaso's convoy, prompting condemnation and calls for arrests from President Obi. President Tinubu sought forgiveness for his absence after the Plateau attack and announced a five-year defence plan while AI-generated disinformation spreads ahead of the election. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/nigeria-s-upcoming-election-marred-by-rising-ai-disinformation/a-79946897?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPQlR2dHlKVUFFZ0oyWHNFMmNuaVVJMHRNTHIwaXZKTk1CVkJ6empqSVoxVkc2TjJPTFYxZk9PR0UzbVZZeDRKV2FocWFqaFRUa01RVDc1TFR2N3R2T3lXbVBWWmVPQTByc05SZS1NS2dJd2Z3cDBDZmYtVHBWUTIyRzVRRnU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQZ3NLNTNRV3VuNm5hbkpvbTYzak5EWkFTb2dRV0VXY3VZMUtLYkk2d0xOa3c3UlBBcHl1ak1FZlJfNndjMGZIUUk4NG5NaVJTMjRnYVZUXzc3MHp4alZoT0JtSk4zT3NQaGxUNGhRRjJBa3R5eVdIV2tyQXhvQ2FDMkdfSkFnNk5LLTJtY093cjl5UWVqRVdJYkdJbFEzQUVZTkkxRGxKcjdjRDFQT1ZEUzRhMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNOVV0dmo5OWl3UENKbEVKWFd4UDZ4Mm1tT3Bfbm9NZjN1TWZYVGxjdDZ0RHBSYWxTdUo4cjRsckxzVm8yaWtyM1BrZnFRTFh6TlJ5STUyRHE3X0kyNVllRXRiSDZQQkY5RlZGaWZJMW5DSjdibzRvUFJNT2FJbXl6WGJPVVhFYmNod3RNaXcxMU8tOW5MWmlnaE10bkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTFBReXVJS29HV3ktclVMVlM2S0dXQl8tM21taUNGMU9fUklUT1ZzV1BVcFVNWXF4LVkxSGZEV29zakI5X29h